[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9302.389, "timestamp": "02:35:02", "text": "。 嗯，我觉得有些星空"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9305.429, "timestamp": "02:35:05", "text": "爱好者，或者说社区成员，会做星空"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9308.79, "timestamp": "02:35:08", "text": "剪辑之类的事情。 是的。 但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9311.27, "timestamp": "02:35:11", "text": "这些都是在指令范围内的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9313.67, "timestamp": "02:35:13", "text": "比如人们可以随意剪辑视频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9317.91, "timestamp": "02:35:17", "text": "等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9322.15, "timestamp": "02:35:22", "text": "我自己只会保留两个频道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9324.15, "timestamp": "02:35:24", "text": "频道太多的话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9326.87, "timestamp": "02:35:26", "text": "管理起来会很困难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9330.79, "timestamp": "02:35:30", "text": "。 是的，目前我暂定采用这种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9332.63, "timestamp": "02:35:32", "text": "形式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9335.19, "timestamp": "02:35:35", "text": "我想，将来我可能会改变。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9343.67, "timestamp": "02:35:43", "text": "是的，跟战争频道差不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9345.59, "timestamp": "02:35:45", "text": "我当时完全搞不清楚你在跟谁说话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9347.67, "timestamp": "02:35:47", "text": "。 然后我把它发布到了YouTube上。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.11, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "我正在YouTube上直播。 迪萨，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9353.27, "timestamp": "02:35:53", "text": "我的天哪，好久不见了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9357.03, "timestamp": "02:35:57", "text": "你好吗？ 希望你一切都好。"}]